title: Consolidate CI script tests with pinned pytest dependencies

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Run the command-bot and prdoc tests through pytest with shared pinned test
      dependencies and isolated script fixtures. Consolidate repeated benchmark,
      label and prdoc cases while preserving the existing scenarios and covered
      production lines and branches. Add coverage for both logging-setup paths.
      CI installs the test dependencies in a temporary virtual environment.
      Runtime script behavior is unchanged. No crates require publishing.
crates: []
